                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Expiring Affordable Care Act tax credits is not an issue Congress can wait to address in December. CT residents will receive notices of premium increases this month. \n\nAccess Health CT CEO James Michel made it crystal clear today that families across the state will see their health care costs skyrocket if Washington doesn\u2019t act.",
