                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Speaker Johnson is cancelling votes \u2013 again. I\u2019m ready to talk, compromise, and negotiate to get to a bipartisan agreement to reopen the government and avoid massive health insurance price hikes. This is the basic duty of a governing body and Speaker Johnson should call his members back to DC to get the job done.",
