                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Tomorrow at 6:30PM, I\u2019m hosting a live telephone town hall to discuss the government shutdown and the urgent need for Congress to prevent a health care cost hike.\n\nSign up at https://t.co/Y3aEkQOywN or join by calling 855-905-3301. https://t.co/FymzksdBFF",
