                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Lee Burdette Williams wrote into my office describing the steep increase in health care costs she will see if Congress lets Affordable Care Act tax credits expire. \n\nCongress can\u2019t keep kicking this down the road. Families will see the cost-hikes in a matter of days when Access Health CT notices go out and enrollment starts on November 1st.",
