                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump's health care cuts won't just impact small segments of the country. They are going to hurt the entire health care system. \n\nThank you to Heather Brauth from Salem, CT, a registered surgical nurse & union leader at Backus Hospital in Norwich, for coming to Washington to share the realities frontline caregivers experience because of these cuts.",
