                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump is giving $40 BILLION to his elite friends in Argentina \u2014 but NOTHING to our health care system or our farmers while Americans face a huge cost hike. A shocking side by side. It\u2019s outrageous. https://t.co/9bMZo7nItY",
