                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, CT residents with Access Health CT health plans will start receiving notice of their 2026 health insurance premium increases. \n\nThe White House & Congress need to hear the real-life cost hikes people are facing. \n\nI'm asking you to share how much your health care costs are increasing at https://t.co/dL5LOWZ9WI.",
