                "text": "Open enrollment for Access Health CT health care plans begins today. 22,000 people in eastern CT are facing premium increases because Congress has failed to maintain longstanding ACA tax credits. \n\nYesterday, I spoke to Diane from Danielson, whose premiums are going up from $460/month to $820/month. She is not alone. Congress cannot wait to act.",
