                "text": "The Senate's funding deal abandons health care support for 24 million Americans and excludes critical funding for Columbia-class submarine construction. \n\nI\u2019ve heard from people across CT\u2019s Second District whose health care costs are set to skyrocket under this bill. It\u2019s a total non-starter for eastern CT.",
