                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 2025, my office worked with veterans in Connecticut\u2019s Second District on 144 cases involving VA benefits and successfully returned $207,348 in earned benefits to constituents. \n\nIn one case, a New London County veteran was left with huge medical bills due to an administrative error at the VA. My office successfully worked with the West Haven VA to have his bills paid through community care benefits. For assistance working with the VA, call my Norwich office at (860) 886-0139.",
