                "text": "My office continues to hear from eastern CT residents whose health care costs are skyrocketing because Congress has failed to extend Affordable Care Act tax credits. \n\nYesterday, I met with Dr. Domenic Casablanca and physicians at Middlesex Health in East Hampton to discuss the urgent need for Congress to lower the cost of health care coverage.",
