                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On Nov 12, I joined 214 House members to sign a discharge petition to extend Affordable Care Act tax credits and lower skyrocketing health care costs for 22 million Americans. Now,\u00a0four more members have signed on,\u00a0crossing the threshold to force a vote on this measure\u00a0after months of obstruction by Speaker Johnson. \n\nThe vote will be a defining moment for a Congress that has turned a deaf ear to pleas of small businesses, working families, and the middle class who are about to be condemned to losing affordable health insurance.",
